      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Ipswich has become a sought‑after filming spot, with movies like The Railway Man, San Andreas, and Inspector Gadget 2 shot around its railyards.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
